# Data privacy

Never commit sensitive or large session data from this lab:

- `data/raw/**` (including `data/raw/manual/*.jsonl`)
- `data/processed/**`
- `data/backups/*.zip`
- `data/manifest.jsonl`
- `data/splits/**`
- `data/distill/**` (session packs, LLM insights, workflow drafts)
- `data/artifact-drafts/**`

Safe to commit: scripts, portable `docs/` (not `docs/**/*.local.md`), `.cursor/`, and reference lists like `docs/GOLD_SESSIONS.md` (session UUIDs and repo hints only — no transcript text).

Do not hardcode absolute home paths in committed docs — use `~`, env overrides, or gitignored `docs/*.local.md`.

Before suggesting a git add, check paths against `.gitignore`. Do not paste transcript content into committed markdown.
